# Pakasir v2 setup
# 1. Run supabase/pakasir_payments_setup.sql in the Supabase SQL Editor.
#    Prerequisites: token_wallet_payments_setup.sql + billing_credits_refactor.sql.
#    Then run supabase/pakasir_payment_methods_setup.sql for QRIS/VA selection.
# 2. Fill PAKASIR_API_KEY and PAKASIR_SLUG in .env, then restart the backend.
#    Keep PAKASIR_ALLOW_SANDBOX=false in production.
# 3. Webhook is optional. If enabled, set its URL to
#    https://YOUR_BACKEND/api/payments/pakasir/webhook in the Pakasir project.
#    Copy the project's webhook secret into PAKASIR_WEBHOOK_SECRET.
# 4. Without webhook, frontend MUST poll GET /orders/:id every >=5 seconds
#    while payment is pending, and again on return from checkout. Polling
#    verifies with Pakasir and grants credits; redirects alone grant nothing.
#    No background reconciliation job is installed.
# 5. Read checkoutUrl to redirect to Pakasir QRIS checkout, or render
#    payment.qr_string with payment.total_payment and payment.expired_at.
#    If checkoutAvailable=false, retry SAME order via POST /orders/:id/checkout.
#    QRIS: checkoutUrl always includes qris_only=1. Redirect remains Pakasir's
#    default browser history behavior; no custom redirect is configured.
#    VA: checkoutUrl=null, checkoutAvailable=true; display payment.va_number,
#    payment.payment_method, payment.total_payment and payment.expired_at.
#    method defaults to qris; FE can send a supported bank code for VA.
#    GET /payments/me includes paymentMethods [{code,name,minAmount,maxAmount}].
#    The method is stored on the order and cannot be changed by retry requests.
# 6. Plan purchases start a fresh one-month period and replace previous
#    subscription/free credits. Topup credits remain and expire after 12 months.
#    Only users with an active paid plan may create topup orders. Eligibility
#    is captured at order creation; a payment already accepted is still honored
#    if the subscription expires while checkout is pending.
# 7. Limits are in-memory per Node process (create <=2/s, status >=4s/txn).
#    Use one payment worker or implement a shared limiter before adding replicas.
# Sources: https://pakasir.com/p/create-transaction
#          https://pakasir.com/p/transaction-status
#          https://pakasir.com/p/webhook

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_USER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@planId = REPLACE_WITH_SUBSCRIPTION_PLAN_UUID
@packageId = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_PACKAGE_UUID
@orderId = REPLACE_WITH_RETURNED_ORDER_UUID

### Buy a paid subscription. Price and credits come from the database.
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"planId":"{{planId}}","method":"qris"}

### Buy a topup (paid subscription required).
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"packageId":"{{packageId}}"}

### Buy a plan via a specific VA bank. Render the returned VA number in FE.
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"planId":"{{planId}}","method":"bni_va"}

# Supported method values (generic payment_link is not accepted):
# qris, bri_va, bni_va, cimb_niaga_va, danamon_va, maybank_va,
# bnc_va, bsi_va, muamalat_va, ocbc_va.
# VA limits: IDR 10,000-50,000,000. QRIS: IDR 500-10,000,000.
# Key response fields under data:
# id: internal order UUID used for polling/retry
# status: pending, paid, cancelled (stop polling when terminal)
# order_type: subscription or topup
# payment_method: selected method, default qris
# amount_idr: base product price, credits: purchased AI Credits
# checkoutAvailable: payment instructions ready; false means retry same order
# checkoutUrl: QRIS-only link or null for VA
# payment.txn_id: provider transaction identifier
# payment.amount, payment.fee, payment.total_payment: provider payment totals
# payment.qr_string: QR text (QRIS); payment.va_number: bank VA number (VA)
# payment.expired_at: expiry timestamp
# Poll response uses data.status="paid" for both first and duplicate success.
# On paid, stop polling and refresh plan/balance. Never grant credits in FE.

### Verify payment and apply the purchased benefits exactly once.
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Recover checkout after a timeout; reuses the same Pakasir order.
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/orders/{{orderId}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
